Steps:
[AUTH] Obtain a Bearer token for {{ADMIN}} via POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token (password grant)
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/page-builder-assets/search with {folderUrl: @td(PB_ASSETS_P500.folderUrl), skip: 0, take: 100}
[CAPTURE] the 100 asset URLs from results[]
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/page-builder-assets/references with {storeId: @td(STORE_PRIMARY.id), assetUrls: <the 100 URLs>, includePages: false}
[STATUS] Verify HTTP 200
[BODY] results[] has 100 entries, one per URL; the entry of @td(PB_ASSET_REF_1.rel) has referencesCount @td(PB_ASSET_REF_1.expectedRefs)
[HTTP] POST references with {storeId: @td(STORE_PRIMARY.id), folderUrl: @td(PB_ASSETS_DEEP.folderUrl), includePages: true}
[STATUS] Verify HTTP 200
[BODY] referencesCount = @td(PB_ASSET_REF_DEEP.expectedRefs) and the page list contains the page with id in @td(PB_ASSET_REF_DEEP.pageIds) (a usage 5 levels below the folder)
